    "appVersion": "0.1.0",
    "description": "A 5 V step charges 1 µF through 1 kΩ. τ = RC = 1 ms: after 1 ms the capacitor reaches 63 % (3.16 V), after 5 ms it is essentially full. The source then steps back to 0 V and it discharges."
  },
